sequenceDiagram
  participant Student
  participant API
  participant Pricing
  participant PSP
  Student->>API: Select package and billing country
  API->>Pricing: Market eligibility + active price book
  Pricing-->>API: Immutable quote amount_minor currency tax expiry
  API-->>Student: Quote and charge currency
  Student->>API: Confirm checkout with idempotency key
  API->>PSP: Create intent with merchant profile and amount
  PSP-->>API: Webhook signed event
  API->>API: Verify dedup and reconcile ledger
  API-->>Student: Paid entitlement or pending status
